  "notes": "TYPES: `peek_used` takes the record its one caller passes, `report`'s own struct_N, and `same` takes `char *`. The getter keeps `void *` (a lone field needs `fields`), and so does the qsort callback, whose address escapes. `mark` is passed a string too, but stores a four-byte constant through it, which a `char *` would print as four char stores, so it stays `void *`.",
